md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Renderer emits the source view and code anchors[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]adapter-source-view[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]adapter-source-view: web-clip adapter keeps image origins, writes [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]render/source.html and render/code-anchors.json, injects [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Chrome-destination anchors for every printed pre, and reports both [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]paths; the Rust client decodes them.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Single web articles save source.md and a catalog[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]web-article-store[dim] · [dim][/dim]after adapter-source-view[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]web-article-store: read Chrome catalog /Dests, convert the source view [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to GFM, catalog it with the existing filters, map anchor and annotation [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pages, and write the web_article store and pointer on every [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]single-article create path, with tests and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Multi-URL collections save one source and catalog[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]web-collection-store[dim] · [dim][/dim]after web-article-store[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]web-collection-store: persist a web_collection store from the compose [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]response before collection intake, numbering anchors across parts.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Web overwrites repoint instead of clearing[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]web-overwrite-store[dim] · [dim][/dim]after web-collection-store[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]web-overwrite-store: stage the new web store inside the overwrite [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]transaction after capture instead of clearing source_markdown, keeping [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Clear for PDF URL and arXiv and as the fallback.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Hidden-row reasons name web pages[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-hint-copy[dim] · [dim][/dim]after web-article-store[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-hint-copy: in bob-mac-capture, reword the no-saved-Markdown code and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]link reasons to say Markdown or a web page, with tests and docs; no [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]logic change.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-d3","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-d3.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-d3e19f21c6a4040885e063828cf903a4","started_at":"2026-10-27T15:22:34.224742+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"88e4ba1cb7036b2b0d7195670668bdeb203537c1e0a8e7e86695daff4b14ba4e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-d3.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"9b856d007e096e2015c9bc645e81775dcad8078d05de3b70fce4a16f4253537e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-d3.land/meta.json","size_bytes":716},"prompt":{"digest":"a651ba267865516bb9265e09598ac825d1f01f401bed675617213ac77066c22e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-d3.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":309},"state":{"digest":"e5b1ebc6f8dc0129b6bba99c21a38df81045a122fb571fb58ca818067d802a90","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-d3.land/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-d3.